 { Material is about even, but White's following rook transfer decided the battle. } 1. { -KEY- } Re5 $1 { Heading for e7 in order to seize the seventh rank with both rooks. } Be8 ( { Or } 1... Rxb2 2. Re7 Bc8 3. Rh7 { with similar consequences as in the game. } ) 
 ( 1... Re8 { is equally hopeless in view of } 2. Rxe8 Bxe8 3. Rc8 { , as observed by nayoncohr. } ) 
2. Ree7 Rxa5 ( { If } 2... Bxh5 3. Rh7 Kg8 4. Rxh5 { , White emerges two pawns up in the ending. } ) 
3. Rh7+ Kg8 4. Rcg7+ Kf8 5. h6 $1 { In view of the imminent mate, Black resigned. } 
